@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #139D90
 LifeLineBorderColor #A5BFC2
 ParticipantBackgroundColor #183840
 ParticipantBorderColor #183840
 ParticipantFontColor white
 ActorBorderColor #183840
 ActorFontColor #183840
 GroupBorderColor #139D90
 GroupBackgroundColor #EAF6F3
 GroupHeaderFontColor #183840
 NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
 NoteBorderColor #F66B22
}
actor Student
participant Frontend as FE
participant "REST Controller" as API
participant ProfileService as S
database PostgreSQL as DB
title Replace the whole schedule | US-05
Student -> FE: Save complete edited schedule
FE -> API: HTTPS PUT /api/v1/availability/me\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>\nAvailabilityInput JSON
ref over FE, DB
matching_00_authentication: valid JWT, ACTIVE account, STUDENT role
end ref

API -> S: replaceAvailability(verified sub, schedule)
S -> S: Validate timeZone and ALL slot ranges
alt invalid slot or missing required field
 S --> API: VALIDATION_ERROR; preserve old schedule
 API --> FE: 422 + ErrorEnvelope
else valid complete schedule (items may be empty)
 S -> DB: BEGIN; replace own schedule atomically
 alt transaction commits
  DB --> S: Saved schedule
  S --> API: Availability
  API --> FE: 200 OK + Availability
 else storage failure
  DB --> S: ROLLBACK; old schedule remains
  S --> API: INTERNAL_ERROR
  API --> FE: 500 + ErrorEnvelope
 end
end
FE --> Student: Updated schedule or error
note over S,DB: items: [] clears availability. Repeated PUT never appends slots.
@enduml
